nt/javascript-76","page_id":"/docs/development/javascript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/javascript#cart-fragments","content":"The mini-cart and cart-count widgets update without a page reload via the\n**fragments** system:"},"887":{"id":"/docs/development/javascript-77","page_id":"/docs/development/javascript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/javascript#cart-fragments","content":"The background get\\_refreshed\\_fragments request is uncached and\nruns on every page for every visitor with the script loaded — a\nmeasurable TTFB cost on a busy store. Since WooCommerce 7.8 core only\nenqueues wc-cart-fragments when a Mini-Cart (widget or block) is\npresent on the page. If a theme or plugin still loads it site-wide and you\ndo not use a live mini-cart, dequeue it outside cart/checkout."},"888":{"id":"/docs/development/javascript-78","page_id":"/docs/development/javascript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/javascript#blocks-reading-state-in-js","content":"Values passed from PHP (via an `IntegrationInterface`) are read with\n`getSetting()` from `@woocommerce/settings`."},"889":{"id":"/docs/development/javascript-79","page_id":"/docs/development/javascript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/javascript#related","content":"<Card title=\"AJAX\" href=\"/docs/development/ajax\" description=\"The request side of the classic front-end — wc-ajax, nonces, params objects.\" />"},"890":{"id":"/docs/development/javascript-80","page_id":"/docs/development/javascript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/javascript#related","content":"<Card title=\"Blocks\" href=\"/docs/development/blocks\" description=\"The React front-end and its data stores that replace this event bus.\" />"},"891":{"id":"/docs/development/javascript-81","page_id":"/docs/development/javascript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development/javascript#related","content":"<Card title=\"Shortcodes\" href=\"/docs/development/shortcodes\" des