","content":"<Card title=\"WooCommerce Data Model\" href=\"/docs/foundations/woocommerce-data-model\" description=\"Where product and variation data is stored.\" />"},"1769":{"id":"/docs/lifecycle/products-63","page_id":"/docs/lifecycle/products","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/lifecycle/products#related","content":"<Card title=\"Cart\" href=\"/docs/lifecycle/cart\" description=\"How product prices become line totals.\" />"},"1770":{"id":"/docs/lifecycle/products-64","page_id":"/docs/lifecycle/products","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/lifecycle/products#related","content":"<Card title=\"Filters\" href=\"/docs/development/filters\" description=\"The getter filters that wrap every price and stock field.\" />"},"1771":{"id":"/docs/lifecycle/shipping-and-tax","page_id":"/docs/lifecycle/shipping-and-tax","type":"page","content":"Shipping & Tax","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Commerce Lifecycle"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/lifecycle/shipping-and-tax"},"1772":{"id":"/docs/lifecycle/shipping-and-tax-0","page_id":"/docs/lifecycle/shipping-and-tax","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/lifecycle/shipping-and-tax","content":"The shipping and tax subsystems — shipping zones, methods and packages, how rates are produced and filtered, then tax classes, rates, the calculation, and where inclusive/exclusive pricing and rounding are decided."},"1773":{"id":"/docs/lifecycle/shipping-and-tax-1","page_id":"/docs/lifecycle/shipping-and-tax","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/lifecycle/shipping-and-tax#shipping","content":"Shipping"},"1774":{"id":"/docs/lifecycle/shipping-and-tax-2","page_id":"/docs/lifecycle/shipping-and-tax","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/lifecycle/shipping-and-tax#zones-methods-packages","content":"Zones, methods, packages"},"1775":{"id":"/docs/lifecycle/shipping-and-tax-3","page_id":"/docs/lifecycle/shipping-and-tax","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/lifecycle/shipping-and-tax#adding-a-shipping-method","content":"Adding a shipping method"},"1776":{"i